<%# locals: () %>
<section class="settings__section">
  <header>
    <h2 class="divider">Keep it in order</h2>
  </header>
  <ul class="record-steps txt-small">
    <li>Confirm the <%= term(:client).downcase %> owns an account before anyone is removed from it. Removing an agency first can cut off everyone’s access.</li>
    <li>An account owned by a third party gets moved to the <%= term(:client).downcase %>’s own business portfolio.</li>
    <li>Record when each token expires; home warns <%= (AccountManagement::Playbook::TOKEN_WARNING / 1.day).round %> days ahead. Prefer tokens that don’t expire (a system user) where the platform offers one.</li>
    <li>Say where the login lives, never what it is.</li>
  </ul>
</section>
